  (H, "The link is created by the observer, not by the protocol. Anyone can scan the blockchain for outputs to the same address and list the payments, the amounts and the dates. A fresh address splits the history into pieces that have nothing visible in common. The chapter's checks illustrate the principle with a set: three payments to one address give one distinct address, three payments to three addresses give three."),
